// is `shrink-0` in Figma — it flows naturally with its content rather than filling the drawer
// to the bottom. Buttons appear immediately after the accordion group (64px gap), with
// whitespace below in the collapsed state. The parent ZimmDrawer wrapper owns `overflow-y: auto`
